<div>
<h2 id="prime-day-extended">Prime Day Is Over, but the Deals Are Not</h2>

<p>Amazon's Prime Day 2026 officially ended earlier this week, but <strong>Best Buy is running a late Prime Day sale on Kindle devices through Sunday, July 26.</strong> If you missed Amazon's event or wanted a better deal on a specific model, this is your last window to save before the sale ends.</p>

<p>The timing is particularly interesting for EPUB readers. With Amazon's recent shift toward EPUB — <a href="/blog/amazon-kdp-epub-only-submission-2026/">KDP now requires EPUB submissions starting September 2026</a>, and <a href="/blog/amazon-kdp-epub-downloads-2026/">Amazon now lets you download KDP books as EPUB</a> — buying a Kindle today comes with a very different ebook ecosystem than it did even six months ago. EPUB is finally a first-class format in Amazon's world.</p>

<p>This guide covers every deal currently live at Best Buy, evaluates each model for EPUB readers, and helps you decide whether to buy now or wait for the rumored late-2026 Kindle lineup refresh.</p>

<hr />

<h2 id="best-buy-deals">Best Buy Late Prime Day Kindle Deals: Full Breakdown</h2>

<p>The following deals are available at Best Buy US through July 26, 2026. Prices and availability were verified live on July 24.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
